{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_14\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 14</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db233efaaf004184bf1e6bfb30f92e062965290e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A&#39;s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" />, three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/5758604e17720a8acfa5c6fa2afc582857701a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B&#39;s}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"11\" />, and three  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e604789b7cbae85b2a247b8a34563c489690e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{C&#39;s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> are placed in the nine spaces so that each row and column contain one of each letter. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> is placed in the upper left corner, how many arrangements are possible?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8bdf881057552dc4d90a565dcc73fef0f5ccf5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size((80)); draw((0,0)--(9,0)--(9,9)--(0,9)--(0,0)); draw((3,0)--(3,9)); draw((6,0)--(6,9)); draw((0,3)--(9,3)); draw((0,6)--(9,6)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (1.5,7.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"135\" height=\"135\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f68a620e8d126d7a4d48fcd5878a055aaa4ab6db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Solution</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ways to place the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efdf9d38e73383003015dbd006f35250c17be82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{As}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ways to place the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d3390b470a65916c0f5e1a2d1b318be2cd8bbb5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Bs}$\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> way to place the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/6/cf6c3be45a42fdd4728374f062e46b5b172ed9d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Cs}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5c60420ac0c000252c429cc1284ed33a2398e83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)(2)(1) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8qzMymleTIg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8qzMymleTIg</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1m_c_iMvxKo\">https://youtu.be/1m_c_iMvxKo</a>  Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problem